# What sits at the package root and is not package content. The archive is
# the manifest's closure plus "files", so none of this would ship anyway;
# naming it here is what says the omission was decided rather than forgotten.

# The Rust workspace. The three .wasm files src/index.sql names are pulled
# back in by the closure; the sources that built them, and the native tool,
# are read on GitHub.
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
core/
rows/
container/
weave/
records/
spaces/
tool/

# The worked example, which is a pointer to ffrwd/describe's own recipes and
# a set of numbers, not something an installed package runs.
examples/

# Local development state: which archive of each dependency this checkout
# resolved to, which a consumer solves for itself.
ffrwd.lock
